-marsh-transfer-indiana","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan State WR Nick Marsh plans to enter transfer portal","description":"Michigan State wide receiver Nick Marsh plans to enter the NCAA transfer portal, his agent Allante Gardner of VaynerSports told ESPN on Monday.","published":"2025-12-01T21:49:24.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/47169056/michigan-state-wr-nick-marsh-plans-enter-transfer-portal","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Spartans' Nick Marsh, Makhi Frazier expected to play","description":"After suffering injuries last week against Youngstown State, Michigan State wide receiver Nick Marsh and leading rusher Makhi Frazier are expected to play at USC, sources told ESPN.","published":"2025-09-19T20:33:26.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/46315234/sources-spartans-nick-marsh-makhi-frazier-expected-play","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079600/nick-marsh","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Marsh_(American_football)"},"pick":{"pick":24,"round":1,"team":"CIN","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Nick Marsh (American football)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nick_Marsh_(American_football)","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-22T23:50:20Z","intro":"Nick Marsh (born October 1, 2006) is an American college football wide receiver for the Indiana Hoosiers. He previously played for the Michigan State Spartans."}}